certificate_expiry.body:
Dear {emp_name},

This is a reminder that your {certificate} expires on {expiry_date} — {days_left} day(s) from today.

Please renew it and share the renewed copy with HR before the expiry date so your work is not interrupted.

Employee ID: {emp_code}
Designation: {designation}
Branch: {branch}
Reporting manager: {reporting_manager}

Regards,
HR — {company}

absent_yesterday.body:
Dear {emp_name},

Our attendance shows no punch for you on {absent_date}, and no approved leave for that day, so it is marked ABSENT.

If you were working, please raise an Attendance Regularization in SmartPRS (Time & Attendance → Attendance Regularization) with the correct times. If you were on leave, please apply for it.

Employee ID: {emp_code}
Branch: {branch}
Reporting manager: {reporting_manager}

Regards,
HR, {company}

appraisal_letter.body:
Dear {emp_name},

We are pleased to inform you that, based on your performance rating of {rating} for {review_period}, your annual CTC has been revised from {old_ctc} to {new_ctc} — an increase of {increment_amount} ({increment_pct}%), effective {effective_date}.

We thank you for your contribution and look forward to your continued success.

Employee ID: {emp_code}
Designation: {designation}

Regards,
HR — {company}
